SistersOfDiscord: {
	Spawn: {
		1: Well hello there, what a surprise to see YOU here~!

		2: {
			Broodmother: Oh yes, I've heard PLENTY about you, kid...you've been stirring up quite a bit of trouble in these parts...
			None: Oh yes, I've heard PLENTY about you, kid...you're the little warm-blood who thrashed my mother..!
		}

		3: {
			Both: And mine...
			Hydra: ...and you also hurt my mom...
			None: You're a pretty annoying wretch, you know...
		}

		4: So now..! Heh...
		5: We're gonna give you something to absolutely SCREAM about..! Come on, Hakie, let's torch this little warm-blood~!
		6: Please don't call me Hakie again...ever.
	}

	AsheDowned: OW..! THAT HURT, YOU MEANIE!
	HarukaDowned: Rgh..! Ow...

	Defeat: {
		First: {
			1: You see Ashe? I told you this was a stupid idea, but YOU didn't listen...

			2: {
				Front: "Shut up! I thought if we ganged up on "
				Back: ", we could just beat the daylights out of 'em!"
			}

			3: Whatever...I'm going back home. SOMEONE has to tell dad about this kid.
			4: Hmpf..! Fine! Be that way! I'm going back to the inferno!
		}

		1: RRRRRRRRRGH! NOT AGAIN!!!
		2: Why do I keep going with you..? I should honestly just let you fight them yourself.
		3: Rgh..! Shut up..!
	}
}

Akuma: {
	Attack: {
		Skyfall: {
			A: Hey kid! Sky's fallin', watch out!
			B: Down comes fire and fury!
		}

		BigShot: {
			A: Hey kid! Watch out!
			B: Incoming!
		}

		SeekingFlames: {
			A: Face the flames of despair, kid!
			B: Heads up, kid!
		}
	}

	WaterHit: Water?! ACK..! I CAN'T BREATHE!

	Despawn: {
		Night: Yaaaaaaaaawn. I'm bushed kid, I'm gonna have to take a rain check. Come back tomorrow.
		Escape: I thought you terrarians put up more of a fight. Guess not.
	}

	Defeat: {
		Status: The volcanoes of the inferno are finally quelled...
		NotExpert: Hmpf...you’re pretty good kid, but not good enough. Come back once you’ve gotten a bit better.
	}

	Transition: {
		1: Heh...
		2: You know, kid...
		3: fanning the flames doesn't put them out...
		4: Akuma has been Awakened!
		5: IT ONLY MAKES THEM STRONGER!
		6: The air around you begins to heat up...
	}

	Awakened: {
		AsheAppear: {
			First: {
				Ashe: Hey! Hands off my papa!
				Akuma: Atta-girl..!
			}

			Ashe: You got it, daddy..!
			Akuma: Ashe? Help your dear old dad with this kid again!
		}

		Defeat: {
			Repeat: Heh, not too shabby this time kid. I'm impressed. Here. Take your prize.
			First: GRAH..! HOW!? HOW COULD I LOSE TO A MERE MORTAL TERRARIAN?! Hmpf...fine kid, you win, fair and square. Here's your reward.
			Cheat: Nice. You cheated. Now come fight me in expert mode like a real man.
		}

		DayReset: Nighttime won't save you from me this time, kid! The day is born anew!
		Kill: You just got burned, kid.
	}

	#Unused
	Akuma6: Spirits of the volcano! help me crush this kid!
	Akuma9: Sun's shining, and there's no shade to be seen, kid!
	Akuma10: Getting hotter, ain't it?
	AkumaA5: Still got it, do you? Ya got fire in your spirit! I like that about you, kid!
	AkumaA6: What?! How have you lasted this long?! Why you little... I refuse to be bested by a terrarian again! Have at it!
	AkumaA7: ACK..! WATER! I LOATHE WATER!!!
	AkumaA13: Sky's fallin' again! On your toes!
	AkumaA14: Down comes the flames of fury again!
	AkumaA15: You underestimate the artillery of a dragon, kid!
	AkumaA16: Flames don't give in till the end, kid!
	AkumaA17: Heads up! Volcano's eruptin' kid!
	AkumaA18: INCOMING!
	AkumaA19: Hey Kid? Like Fireworks? No? Too Bad!
	AkumaA20: Here comes the grand finale, kid!
	AkumaA21: The Sun won't quit 'til the day is done, kid!
	AkumaA22: Face the fury of the sun!
	AkumaAAshe1: Papa, NO! HEY! YOU! I'm gonna bake you alive next time we meet..!
	AkumaAAshe2: OW, you Jerk..! I'm out!
}

Anubis: {
	Kill: HAH! Get hosed-- er, sanded.

	Intro: {
		1: {
			Singleplayer: Well, bud. Here we are.
			Multiplayer: Well guys, Here we are.
		}

		2: I hope you're ready for a real fight.
		3: Especially since I'm in my superior form.
		4: You ready? I won't hesitate to slap you silly!
		5: Let's go!
		Rematch: A rematch eh? Alright, this should be fun!
	}

	Combat: {
		PumpkinThrow: YEET
		Runeblast: Careful! Projectiles hurt.
		Summons: Let me grab some friends
		ScepterThrow: Catch!
		BlockCrush: Smashing, Init?
	}

	Transition: {
		1: ...hrgh...
		2: ...alright.
		3: I think...it's time.
		4: No more stops being pulled.
		5: If you're gonna be taking on the dark forces of the world...
		6: I need to make sure you're ready, because...unless you're ready...
		7: ...Some things should stay locked away for your own good.
	}

	Forsaken: {
		Warning: No Warnings this time.
		Kill: ...Sorry, but you aren't ready yet.
		Defeat: ...You done good, bud. Let's make a game plan moving forward. Come talk to me when you're ready.
	}
}

Athena: {
	Intro: {
		First: {
			1: Hmpf..!

			2: {
				Singleplayer: You! Earthwalker!
				Multiplayer: You! Earthwalkers!
			}

			3: My seraphs tell me you've been attacking them! Why?!
			4: I'm gonna teach you a lesson, you little brat!
			5: En Garde!
		}

		PreAthenaA: {
			1: ...So. You came.
			2: It's high time I won my honor back..!
			3: En Garde!
		}

		Repeat: {
			1: Sigh...
			2: Lets just get this overwith. I don't have all day.
		}
	}

	Kill: And stay away...idiot.
	Defeat: OW! Fine, fine..! I'll leave you alone! Geez, you don't let up, do you.

	Transition: {
		1: ...hah...hah...
		2: ...I still lost.
		3: No.
		4: I'm not giving up that easilly.
		5: There's a phrase my people live by, earthwalker.
		6: Brightest of dawn...
		7: Darkest of night...
		8: Even in defeat...
		9: A VARIAN ALWAYS PUTS UP ONE LAST FIGHT!!!
		Repeat: No more kidding around, the storms are calling, and they're coming for you!
	}

	Awakened: {
		Kill: And stay away, idiot.

		Defeat: {
			1: ...WHY?!
			2: ...Why can't I win?!

			3: {
				Singleplayer: ...You haven't heard the end of me, earthwalker...
				Multiplayer: ...You haven't heard the end of me, earthwalkers...
			}

			4: I will win back my honor eventually...
			5: ...until then, watch your back.
			6: Dark, chaotic forces are waking up as of late.
			7: Hopefully HE doesn't come back...
			8: Stay safe.
			Repeat: OW! Fine, fine..! I'll leave you alone! Geez, you don't let up, do you.
		}
	}
}

SeraphHerald1: HEY! EARTHWALKER! YEAH YOU, YA STUPID APE!
SeraphHerald2: Queen Athena requests your presence at the acropolis again immediately!
SeraphHerald3: She demands a rematch, and this time, she won't let you tear her down so easily!
SeraphHerald4: I would say break a leg, but we can do that ourselves when you show up!
SeraphHerald5: See ya twerp!
SeraphHerald6: Oh yeah, and uh, that obnoxious kleptomaniac worm wants to fight you again too or something.

EquinoxDialogue: {
	GravAltar: Deep in the caverns of the world lies the worm king, the guardian of the earth that was created to give us life.
	StarAltar: High in the clouds rules the Seraph Queen, guardian of the skies where the creators watch over us.
	WormAltar: The idol goes into the slot, but nothing happens.
	WormAltarOK: The Idol shines to life, regaining its original coloration
	s: s
	heroes: heroes
	WormSpawn1: It appears someone has reassembled our idol, dearest Daybringer.
	WormSpawn2: It appears so. Little one
	WormSpawn3: ", you have impressed us greatly"
	WormSpawn4: Could they be the one we've been searching for..?
	WormSpawn5: ...possibly.
	WormSpawn6: Young one
	WormSpawn7: . We would like to provide you with one last test.
	WormSpawn8: A test of strength against us.
	WormSpawn9: When you are ready, call us forth with the worm statue in your hand.
	WormSpawn10: We will be able to find you because of these beacons you reactivated.
	WormSpawn11: However...
	WormSpawn12: "Do not expect us to go easy on you, "
}

