Rajah: {
	#Anitcheat Unused
	Cheat: JUSTICE CANNOT BE CHEATED
	Kill: Justice has been served...
	Despawn: Coward.
	Defeat.Murderer: You win this time, murderer...but I will avenge those you've mercilessly slain...

	Awakened: {
		PowerUp: Rajah glows with furious energy as he attacks, strengthening his defenses

		LastStand: {
			Singleplayer: {
				Murderer: THIS ISN'T THE END, MURDERER! RIVALS CLASH TILL THE VERY END!
				Normal: THIS ISN'T THE END, TERRARIAN! RIVALS CLASH TILL THE VERY END!
				Repeat: THIS ISN'T THE END, {0}! RIVALS CLASH TILL THE VERY END!
			}

			Multiplayer: {
				Murderer: THIS ISN'T THE END, MURDERERS! RIVALS CLASH TILL THE VERY END!
				Normal: THIS ISN'T THE END, TERRARIANS! RIVALS CLASH TILL THE VERY END!
			}
		}

		Kill: And stay down.

		Defeat: {
			First: {
				1: Rgh...
				2: ...so...
				3: Even when I'm at my most powerful...
				4: ...I still can't beat you.
				5: ...Terrarian...maybe...
				6: Perhaps this is all just a sign that...maybe my time as protector...
				7: ...is finally up. It might be time to pass on the baton.
				8: ...I forgive you for every rabbit you've killed, but in return...I want you to take my place...
				9: ...as their champion. Their protector.
				10: I only want the best for the creatures of this world...and if you're stronger than I am...

				11: {
					Singleplayer: Who better to take my place than you, {0}?
					Multiplayer: Who better to take my place than you, Terrarians?
				}

				12: Be the one the innocent can look to in their time of need.
				13: Think about it.
				14: And if you ever want to spar...use one of those special carrots. I'd be glad to earn my honor back.
				15: ...See ya, kiddo.
				Status: Rajah Rabbit's speech warms your heart. You no longer have the will to harm rabbits. Do him proud.
			}

			Repeat: {
				Singleplayer: Well fought, {0}. Take your reward.
				Multiplayer: Well fought, Terrarians. Take your reward.
			}
		}
	}
}

