ShenDoragon: {
	Spawn: {
		First: {
			1: Surprised to see us again, Kid?
			2: NYEHEHEHEHEH..! Yes..! Must be shocking to see us here..! But this time, we have a little tricksie up our sleeves..!
			3: That Sigil you just used gave us back our full power, which will let us reach our true, powerful form..!
			4: We used to be the same being..! But then a Terrarian wretch like you split our soul in half..! But now...heheheh...
			5: WE ARE COMPLETE AGAIN
			6: Heh....heheh...
			7: You've made a grave mistake, child...
			8: For you see....
			9: I AM SHEN DORAGON, EMPEROR OF CHAOS AND ANARCHY!
			10: And you, my child...
			11: WILL PERISH!!!
		}
	}

	Summon: Grips! Assist me!

	Health: {
		80: {
			First: What's this? Competence? Impressive.
			Repeat: Quite the skill, kid.
		}

		66: {
			First: Chaos always reigns, kid. You terrarians never seem to learn that.
			Repeat: You're a real fighter, you know. Now stand still and let me grill you.
		}

		30: {
			First: Hmm...still fighting, eh?
			Repeat: Looks like you're turning tide, but not for long!
		}
	}

	Defeat: {
		NotExpert: {
			First: Heh, alright. I’ll leave you alone I guess. But if you come back stronger, I’ll show you the power of true unyielding chaos...
			Repeat: Good show, child, good show. Your combat prowess still impresses me! Maybe some day I'll show you my true power.
		}
	}

	Transition: {
		1: Heh...
		2: Heheheh...
		3: HAHAHAHAHAHAHA!!!
		4: Have you forgotten about our last battles...?
		5: There's always a last stand, kiddo...
		6: But now, you stand in my path...
		7: Shen Doragon has been Awakened!
		8: YOU WILL BURN IN THE FLAMES OF DISCORDIAN HELL!!!
	}

	Awakened: {
		Summon: {
			First: {
				Shen: Girls..? Help your father with this insignificant mortal.
				Ashe: With pleasure, Papa~!
				Haruka: Yes, father.
			}

			Repeat: {
				Shen: Ashe? Haruka? I need your assistance again..!
				Ashe: On it, Papa~!
				Haruka: Again..?
			}

			Flee: {
				Ashe: AGH! Sorry papa..! I gotta bail!
				Haruka: Ngh...sorry father...I can't carry on...
			}
		}

		Health: {
			90: {
				First: Look at where you are, terrarian. This is your own doing. The ritual, the rune? All you.
				Repeat: You put up a real fight, kid.
			}

			80: {
				First: Why do you instigate all these fights? Power? Glory?
				Repeat: Brawlin' till the very end.
			}

			70: {
				First: Either way, I'll personally make sure this is your last one!
				Repeat: You remind me of myself quite a bit...
			}

			60: {
				First: How many times will you fight to tear me down? Or will you give up?
				Repeat: You're strong, too. Takes guts to fight most of what you have.
			}

			50: {
				Thorium: You know, I was watching you beat down that god-sphere and its 3 goons. Gotta admit, pretty impressive.
				Calamity: Considering you put that angsty witch in her place, gotta hand it to ya.
				GRealm: Seeing you squashed that oversided insect in the jungle, that's quite a head-turner.
				Redemption: However, after you walloped that cosmic prude, even I was taken aback by that level of skill.
				Jetshift: But slaying those two meteor-squatting crystal things? That's quite an eye-catcher.
				SpiritOld: Now that I think about it, though, you cracking open that overseer like an egg? Quite the strength that had to have needed.
				NoMod: Everything you've torn down, gods and monsters alike, I respect that.
				#New Additions
				SpiritClassic: Now that I think about it, though, you making that old sentinel crumble to pebbles? Quite the strength that had to have needed.
				StarsAbove: Though after you put down that rogue Starfarer, you really got my attention.
				LunarVeil: Looking back, I gotta give you credit for managing to quell that green goddess punk.
				SacredTools: Dousing that abyssal pumpkin? Now that was a sight to see!
				Catalyst: You really did wipe the floor with the purple pile of sludge.
				Hunt: Must've taken a whole lot to put those slimes back in their place. Who'd have thought they could put up a fight!

				Split: {
					Seth: I'll admit, putting down that sword-slinging hothead was quite the show to witness.
					SethUltimate: I'll admit, putting down that sword-slinging hothead, with his true power unleashed, was quite the show to witness.
				}

				Macrocosm: You even took your fury to the Moon! Now that's something I can get behind.
				Spooky: Tearing through those catacombs like you own the place. That takes some skill.
				Ultranium: Watching you whallop that star slinging hobo? That was a treat!
				You: I mean, shattering your own reflection come alive? That's impressive stuff.
				Radiance: I didn't think that sun fairy was all too impressive until you managed to bring out her full power. That was a spectacle indeed!
				CalamityMod: Mods.AAModClassic.NPCs.BossDialogue.ShenDoragon.Awakened.Health.50.CalamityMod
			}

			30: {
				First: Hm..?! You haven't kicked the bucket yet? Well then...Let's change that!
				Repeat: Hmpf..! Here we are again, gettin' close to the end of the line. I'm not holding back!
			}

			20: {
				First: You little..! Die already!
				Repeat: The end of a game is the most stressful, keep that in mind, kid!
			}

			10: {
				First: This can't be--! How?!
				Repeat: This is it! The end is near, so don't you dare hold back!
			}
		}

		Defeat: {
			First: {
				1: Split again...
				2: This is YOUR fault you insolent worm..! I knew we should have been more aggressive but NOOOOOOOOO..! YOU said we could squash them without even trying!

				3: {
					Singleplayer: "{0}, you will face our fury again one day...either when we gain enough power again..."
					Multiplayer: Warriors, you will face our fury again one day...either when we gain enough power again...
				}

				4: ...or you decide to use that Sigil again..!
				5: Your choice, child.
			}

			Repeat: {
				1: YOU IMBECILE! WE LOST! AGAAAAAAAAAAAAIN!!!
				2: Rgh, my head...

				3: {
					Singleplayer: {
						Male: AND YOU, BOY! NEXT TIME I'M GONNA TEAR YOUR HEAD OFF!!!
						Female: AND YOU, GIRL! NEXT TIME I'M GONNA TEAR YOUR HEAD OFF!!!
					}

					Multiplayer: AND YOU BUNCH OF CLOWNS! NEXT TIME I'M GONNA TEAR YOUR HEADS OFF!!!
				}

				4: And trust us, kid.
				5: There's always a next time.
			}
		}
	}

